---
import { ArrowDown } from '@lucide/astro';
import ResearchFigureFrame from './ResearchFigureFrame.astro';
---

<ResearchFigureFrame
  className="is-open"
  figureNumber="01"
  eyebrow="Observed account + repository evidence"
  title="What the branch can and cannot corroborate"
  caption="The correction now has two durable addresses at different scopes. That makes recurrence less likely; it does not make recurrence impossible."
>
  <div class="incident-evidence">
    <section class="observed-account">
      <span class="label">Author's observed account</span>
      <blockquote>“15+ years of experience designing scalable web architectures, <mark>design systems</mark>, and enterprise platforms.”</blockquote>
      <p>The article reports that this unsupported wording appeared and was corrected.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="boundary" aria-hidden="true"><ArrowDown class="boundary-arrow" size={16} stroke-width={1.75} /></div>

    <section class="repository-evidence">
      <span class="label">What the branch directly shows</span>
      <div class="evidence-rows">
        <div>
          <code>.specify/memory/constitution.md</code>
          <p>Do not describe the experience as design systems unless explicitly established.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <code>specs/001-site-foundation/spec.md</code>
          <p>Use grounded positioning; do not claim formal design-system ownership.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="boundary-note">The branch corroborates the resulting guardrails, not necessarily the complete original chronology.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</ResearchFigureFrame>

<style>
  code {
    border: 0 !important;
    background: transparent !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    white-space: normal !important;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .incident-evidence {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 0.25rem 0 0;
  }

  .observed-account {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }

  .label {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-mono-ui);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.09em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .observed-account blockquote {
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0 !important;
    border: 0 !important;
    border-left: 0 !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-style: normal;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  mark {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 16%, transparent);
    color: inherit;
    padding: 0.04em 0.12em;
  }

  .observed-account p,
  .repository-evidence p {
    margin: 0.55rem 0 0 !important;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .boundary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .boundary :global(.boundary-arrow) {
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .evidence-rows {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1px;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: 0.2rem;
    background: var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .evidence-rows > div {
    background: var(--bg-page);
    padding: 0.9rem;
  }

  code {
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono-ui);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
  }

  .boundary-note {
    margin-top: 0.85rem !important;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
    padding-top: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-muted) !important;
    font-family: var(--font-mono-ui);
    font-size: 0.6875rem !important;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .incident-evidence {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) 7rem minmax(0, 1.2fr);
      align-items: stretch;
      padding: 0.25rem 0 0;
    }

    .boundary {
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .boundary::before {
      width: 1px;
      height: 100%;
      flex: 1;
      border-left: 1px dashed var(--border-subtle);
      content: '';
    }

    .boundary :global(.boundary-arrow) {
      display: none;
    }

    .evidence-rows {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .evidence-rows > div {
      padding: 0.9rem;
    }

    .evidence-rows > div + div {
      padding: 0.9rem;
    }
  }
</style>
